From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] Renderer: register BMI unified spatial reconstruction pipeline

Target reference:
  jsuk10/UE4.27plus_Custom
  Engine/Source/Runtime/Renderer/Private/Renderer.cpp

This installs one primary spatial upscaler. Selected algorithm, optional CAS,
and optional performance overlay are chained by BMIUnifiedSpatialUpscaler.
Frame Generation is not part of this patch and must use a separate temporal
interpolation/presentation stage.

Apply only after confirming the Bright Memory engine snapshot matches the
referenced UE4.27 renderer API and after adding BMIUnifiedSpatialUpscaler.cpp
and .h to the Renderer module source.

--- a/Engine/Source/Runtime/Renderer/Private/Renderer.cpp
+++ b/Engine/Source/Runtime/Renderer/Private/Renderer.cpp
@@
 #include "PostProcess/TemporalAA.h"
-#include "BMISpatialUpscaler.h"
+#include "BMIUnifiedSpatialUpscaler.h"
 DEFINE_LOG_CATEGORY(LogRenderer);
@@
 void FRendererModule::StartupModule()
 {
  GScreenSpaceDenoiser = IScreenSpaceDenoiser::GetDefaultDenoiser();
  GTemporalUpscaler = ITemporalUpscaler::GetDefaultTemporalUpscaler();
 
  FVirtualTextureSystem::Initialize();
- RegisterBMISpatialUpscaler();
+ RegisterBMIUnifiedSpatialUpscaler();
 }
